title: "getMember (stem-bot-v2: src/utils/discord.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_client: client = getDiscordClient()
    q_get_client --> q_get_guild: guildId = getGuildId()
    q_get_guild --> q_fetch_guild: guild = await client.guilds.fetch(guildId)
    q_fetch_guild --> q_fetch_member: member = await guild.members.fetch(discordUid)
    q_fetch_member --> q_return: return member
    q_fetch_member --> q_error: fetch throws error
    q_return --> [*]: member returned
    q_error --> [*]: return null

    note right of q_fetch_member
        INV-001: discordUid passed directly to Discord API without sanitization
        INV-002: Errors silently return null (no distinction between not-found and API error)
    end note
